oser bist, der im Erstgespräch überzeugt, selbstbewusst und hochprofessionell vor Eigentümern auftritt, Einwände souverän löst und Deals bis zum Notartermin bringt.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lust auf grundlegenden Aufbau hast: Statt in festgefahrenen Strukturen zu arbeiten, baust du unser Brokerage Vertical in Berlin von Tag 1 selbst mit auf.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Digitally fluent bist: Du nutzt KI-Tools ganz selbstverständlich im beruflichen Alltag, um schneller zu sein als die Konkurrenz.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fließend Deutsch sprichst.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Deine Benefits</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">€ 150k+ Total Comp: Kompromisslose Vergütung durch ungedeckeltes Provisionsmodell für Top-Performer.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Zero-to-One Growth: Du prägst den Aufbau unseres Transaktionsgeschäfts von Tag 1 an mit, besetzt die absolute Top-Position in Berlin und sicherst dir maximale Skalierungschancen im Unternehmen.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Exklusiver Lead-Zugriff auf 100.000 Einheiten: Keine Kaltakquise. Unser Inside Sales Team versorgt dich kontinuierlich mit qualifizierten, abschlussbereiten Eigentümer-Leads in Berlin.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fahrtkosten-Zuschuss für Termine vor Ort (Mobilitätsbudget in Form von Carsharing-Guthaben).</p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/buena/immobilienmakler-real-estate-agent-berlin-346204","tags":["Operations"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1792932018},{"slug":"sales-executive-dach-berlin-202672","company_name":"Andercore","title":"Sales Executive, DACH","description":"<h2><strong>About Andercore</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Andercore is the AI-native supplier of industrial materials and goods for energy and infrastructure. We execute trade and distribution end-to-end, on our own account, at the speed of compute - and we are becoming the supplier of record for the entire industry.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Industrial procurement is a €900B market in Europe alone and the largest manual market on earth. 95% of customers have no direct access to global supply chains. Materials pass through four or five intermediaries before they reach a site, and 40% of the margin evaporates on the way. For decades, the operating system of this industry was people: people to source, negotiate, finance, ship, and sell.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We built the alternative from scratch. We are the supplier. We buy from global sources and sell to European customers on our own account. Our AI runs the full trade: sourcing, quality, pricing, sales, logistics, credit, and financing. One request. A firm quote in minutes. Delivered on time. For the customer, it feels like buying from their preferred local supplier. No warehouses. No fleet. No inventory risk. Every trade is pre-sold before it is bought.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are also the credit counterparty. Customers are scored and insured in minutes and get up to 60 days of payment terms priced into the quote itself. The working capital behind every trade is bank-funded, not equity-funded.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Where we are today:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong triple-digit-million euro turnover run rate, the majority of it from repeat customers</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Seven European markets live, sourced from suppliers across Asia and beyond</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">80+ people across Berlin (HQ), London, and Shanghai</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">$90M raised in equity and debt, including our $40M Series B, from Atomico, Project A, Target Global, and Inven Capital - with working capital facilities from UniCredit and KfW</p></li></ul><p style=