h3><ul><li><p>Aktive Mitarbeit am Wachstum und der Geschäftsentwicklung von Propago Immobilien</p></li><li><p>Einblicke in den gesamten Vertriebsprozess: von der Marktanalyse bis zur Auftragsgewinnung</p></li><li><p>Eigenständige Aufgaben und Raum für eigene Vertriebs- und Geschäftsideen</p></li><li><p>Möglichkeit einer erfolgsabhängigen Zusatzvergütung bei erfolgreich gewonnenen Aufträgen</p></li><li><p>Direkte Zusammenarbeit mit der Geschäftsführung und Einblicke in unternehmerische Entscheidungen</p></li><li><p>Mitgestaltung unserer Marktpräsenz und Vertriebsstrukturen am neuen Standort Darmstadt</p></li><li><p>Perspektive auf eine langfristige Zusammenarbeit</p></li></ul><h3>Interesse?</h3><p>Dann freuen wir uns auf deinen Lebenslauf und eine kurze Vorstellung deiner Person, bisherigen Erfahrungen und deiner Motivation für Vertrieb und Geschäftsentwicklung.</p><p></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/propago-immobilien/praktikum-business-development-sales-immobilien-darmstadt-272889","tags":["Business Development"],"job_types":["Praktikum","internship","hilfstätigkeit / student"],"location":"Darmstadt","created_at":1792924256},{"slug":"field-account-executive-munich-244444","company_name":"Classpass","title":"Field Account Executive, Munich (m/w/d)","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Playlist, life&#39;s richest moments happen when people step away from screens to move, connect, explore, and play. We&#39;re building the definitive platform for intentional living, connecting people with inspiring experiences in fitness, wellness, and beyond. With popular brands like Mindbody and ClassPass, Playlist empowers businesses and individuals, making it effortless for aspirations to become actions. Join us in reshaping technology&#39;s role to foster meaningful, real-world connections.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ClassPass offers thousands of fitness and wellness experiences worldwide, helping people lead active, balanced lifestyles. Our platform makes discovering and enjoying activities simple, personalized, and joyful—whether it&#39;s fitness classes, self-care sessions, a healthy lunch, or a new adventure. Join us in shaping healthier, more vibrant communities around the globe.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Über das Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Das ClassPass International Team ist für das Wachstum und die Stärkung unseres Partner-Ökosystems in den globalen Märkten verantwortlich. Gemeinsam mit EGYM Wellpass, beide Teil der Playlist-Familie, nutzen wir gezielt Synergien, um unser Angebot noch stärker zu machen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Dazu gehören sowohl die Akquise hochwertiger neuer Partner aus den Bereichen Fitness, Wellness und Erlebnisangebote als auch die Pflege und der Ausbau der Beziehungen zu bestehenden Partnern.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Durch die Kombination aus Marktexpertise, starken lokalen Beziehungen sowie strategischem Vertriebs- und Account-Management stellt das Team sicher, dass wir unseren Mitgliedern einen außergewöhnlichen Mehrwert und unseren Partnern langfristigen Erfolg bieten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Über die Rolle&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Field Account Executive in der Region Munich&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;bist du für das Wachstum unseres Partnernetzwerks in deiner Region verantwortlich. Du gewinnst neue Partner aus den Bereichen Wellness, Fitness und Gesundheit für ClassPass und baust Beziehungen zu bestehenden Partnern weiter aus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Dadurch trägst du maßgeblich dazu bei, dass Tausende Endkund:innen echten Mehrwert durch einen gesunden Lebensstil erleben.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lust auf echten Impact? Dann bewirb dich jetzt!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du identifizierst und akquirierst eigenverantwortlich neue Partner aus den Bereichen Fitness, Wellness und Gesundheit und verantwortest deine eigene Sales Pipeline, von der ersten Kontaktaufnahme bis zum Vertragsabschluss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du baust langfristige, vertrauensbasierte Beziehungen zu deinen Partnern auf und unterstützt sie bei operativen Fragen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du lebst ein Field-first-Mindset: Persönliche Vor-Ort-Termine stehen bei dir an erster Stelle, ergänzt durch gezielte Inside-Sales-Taktiken, um deine Pipeline voranzutreiben.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du baust dir ein starkes Netzwerk in der regionalen Fitness- und Wellness-Community auf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du dokumentierst deine Aktivitäten strukturiert in Salesforce und überzeugst potenzielle Partner bis zum erfolgreichen Vertragsabschluss.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Das bringst du mit&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst ein bis zwei Jahre Vertriebserfahrung mit, idealerweise aus einem schnelllebigen B2B-Umfeld, und beherrschst Field- sowie Inside-Sales-Techniken sicher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du kannst einen erfolgreichen Track Record vorweisen und erreichst oder übertriffst deine monatlichen Ziele regelmäßig.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du wohnst in Munich oder der näheren Umgebung und kennst die Region, die Menschen und die lokale Kultur. Erste Kontakte in die Fitness- und Wellnessbranche sind ein Plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast idealerweise Erfahrung mit Salesforce oder Salesloft und bist sicher im Umgang mit Microsoft Office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist bereit, regelmäßig in deiner Region unterwegs zu sein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du sprichst Deutsch auf muttersprachlichem Niveau und verfügst über sichere Englischkenntnisse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Deine Benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 Urlaubstage pro Jahr plus zusätzliche, unternehmensweite monatliche &lt;strong&gt;Wellness Days&lt;/strong&gt; zum Auftanken, etwa ein Tag pro Monat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote-Arbeit in deiner Region mit der Option auf eine &lt;strong&gt;WeWork All Access-Mitgliedschaft&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vergünstigter ClassPass-Tarif und kostenloser Zugang zur Meditations-App &lt;strong&gt;Calm&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monatliche Zuschüsse: &lt;strong&gt;52 € Wellness-Budget&lt;/strong&gt; über Benepass sowie eine &lt;strong&gt;50 € Homeoffice-Pauschale&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professionelle Unterstützung für deine mentale Gesundheit über &lt;strong&gt;Spring Health&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familienplanungs- und Fruchtbarkeitsleistungen über &lt;strong&gt;Carrot&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teilnahme an unserem Anerkennungsprogramm &lt;strong&gt;Bonusly&lt;/strong&gt;, mit dem wir besondere Leistungen gemeinsam feiern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Kontakt&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;Du hast Fragen zur Rolle oder zum Bewerbungsprozess? Dann melde dich gerne direkt bei mir. Ich freue mich, von dir zu hören!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-text-05 font-main-content-body&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kontaktperson: Andrew Murphy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have we piqued your curiosity?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sound like the role for you? We’d love to hear from you! Even if you’re not 100% sure about potential fit, we still encourage you to apply. We’re looking for the right person, not the perfect series of checkboxes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Company is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We highly value diversity at our company and encourage people of all different backgrounds, experiences, abilities and perspectives to apply. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability status, or other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By entering your email and phone number and submitting your application, you consent to receive emails, calls and SMS about your application and other roles at The Company, including by auto-dialer. Message and data rates may apply. Opt-out or text STOP to cancel at any time. If you are a California resident or reside outside the United States then by submitting your application you confirm that you have read, understood, agree and - where applicable - grant your prior, free, informed and express consent for the processing of your personal information, including sensitive personal information, as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://co.mindbodyonline.com/legal/california-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://co.mindbodyonline.com/legal/international-team-member-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;International Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;(as applicable).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/classpass/field-account-executive-munich-244444","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792922114},{"slug":"senior-commercial-sales-representative-german-speaker-402083","company_name":"Sentinellabs","title":"Senior Commercial Sales Representative (German Speaker)","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As a Senior Commercial Sales Representative you will accelerate SentinelOne&#39;s growth across accounts in Germany, taking ownership of expanding our commercial footprint by identifying opportunities, driving new business, and consistently surpassing ambitious sales goals. You will own the entire sales cycle — from prospecting to closing — building meaningful relationships with organizations and collaborating with our channel ecosystem to maximize success across your territory. If you are energized by competition, inspired by collaboration, and motivated to make an impact at a fast-moving cybersecurity leader, this is your opportunity to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;What Will You Do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Primary responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own the full sales cycle from prospecting through to close, targeting accounts across Germany, qualifying opportunities, negotiating with key decision-makers, and delivering results through disciplined forecasting, pipeline management, and proactive account planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and manage a high-performing pipeline by leveraging multiple lead sources, outbound strategies, and channel partnerships, while collaborating with field sales teams and cross-functional stakeholders to amplify reach and accelerate deal velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to customers by developing deep knowledge of SentinelOne&#39;s solutions and the broader cybersecurity landscape, delivering tailored, value-driven conversations that address each client&#39;s specific needs and challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Stay ahead of industry trends and competitive dynamics to continuously refine your consultative sales approach, and provide timely and accurate forecasts, insights, and strategic feedback to sales leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;What Skills and Knowledge Will You Bring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Fluency in both English and German, with excellent written and verbal communication skills and exceptional presentation, storytelling, and objection-handling skills that build trust and inspire customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;At least 2 years of direct sales experience at a software vendor, with a proven record of closing net new logos, driving territory growth, and consistently exceeding targets in the commercial segment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience selling into commercial organizations, with a background in working with or through channel partners to maximize collaboration and reach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;The ability to manage complex sales cycles from initial qualification through to executive-level negotiations, with comfort operating in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Prior cybersecurity experience is a strong advantage, combined with a results-driven, competitive, and self-motivated mindset and a Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Why SentinelOne?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive leave benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-neutral parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance &amp;amp; Financial Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical and insurance benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accident insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Perks &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global home office allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-from-home &amp;amp; internet allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne participates in the E-Verify Program for all U.S. based roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/sentinellabs/senior-commercial-sales-representative-german-speaker-402083","tags":["44200 Unified Commercial - EMEA"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792922114},{"slug":"speculative-applications-for-go-to-market-roles-196011","company_name":"Staffbase","title":"Speculative Applications for Go-To-Market roles","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t see the right role open at the moment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
