<li><span data-contrast="auto">Drive franchise narrative, player promise, and creative direction across reveals, beats, and post-launch moments </span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></li>
<li><span data-contrast="auto">Protect the game team from operational noise so they can focus on building, while translating publishing priorities into work the team can act on </span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></li>
<li><span data-contrast="auto">Keep the north star intact on both ends, keeping publishing grounded in the game’s vision, and the game team grounded in player and market reality </span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></li>

</div>
</div><br><strong>What You Bring</strong><br><div>
<div>

<li><span data-contrast="auto">8+ years working at the seam between game development and publishing or marketing, with significant time embedded inside game teams</span></li>
<li><span data-contrast="auto">Proven ability to translate creative vision into commercial activation without compromising either side, with strong creative judgement and editorial instinct you can defend under pressure </span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></li>
<li><span data-contrast="auto">Fluency across business models (premium, live service, DLC, F2P) and multi-year roadmap strategy, and how the two shape the player promise </span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></li>
<li><span data-contrast="auto">Cross-functional leadership and the ability to influence without authority across game and publishing teams </span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></li>
<li><span data-contrast="auto">Strong player insight, audience segmentation, and community fluency </span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></li>
<li><span data-contrast="auto">Drive and operating range, comfortable moving from creative critique in the morning to commercial trade-offs in the afternoon </span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></li>
<li><span data-contrast="auto">Experience supporting or launching at least one major game or live-service title from inside the game team </span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></li>
<li><span data-contrast="auto">Track record of being trusted by both game leadership and publishing leadership </span><span data-ccp-props="{}">&nbsp;</span></li>

