<div>You can expect extensive assistance with visa, work permits, and communication with authorities during the relocation process, as well as help settling into Germany (e.g. setting up appointments with banks, government agencies, schools, landlords, finding apartments etc.).</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div><strong>Company Apartment&nbsp;</strong></div>
<div>To help you get settled, we provide you with a fully furnished company apartment during your first three months in Frankfurt.</div>
