<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div><strong>State-of-the-art Office</strong></div>
<div>We’ve recently moved into a brand-new, modern office located in the heart of Frankfurt. Our new workspace is designed to inspire creativity and collaboration, with open areas, quiet zones, and top-tier facilities — all just steps away from public transport, restaurants, bars and cultural hotspots.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
