&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build strong working relationships with Finance to ensure savings methodologies are aligned, benefits are validated, and impacts are reflected in forecast updates, budgets, and financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Create transparency across initiative owners, milestones, financial impacts, dependencies, and risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Influence without authority across a fast-moving, matrixed organization, ensuring teams are aligned around common goals and accountable for delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
