&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience in consumer products, retail, eCommerce, durable goods, or high-growth global operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience leading cost reduction, operational efficiency, productivity, or transformation initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of logistics, distribution, transportation, warehousing, delivery operations, and cost-to-serve drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Experience managing a portfolio of cross-functional initiatives with multiple owners, timelines, dependencies, and financial impacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven ability to partner with Finance on savings validation, forecasting, budgeting, or financial performance tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to turn complex data into clear insights, recommendations, and action plans&lt;/li&gt;
