k alongside the team during those days. </p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>What You'll Achieve:</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with customers on forward deployed engagements from discovery through launch, translating business goals and workflow requirements into scalable clear solution design and Notion solutions that drive durable adoption.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design scalable Notion architectures that translate customer workflows, permission and governance needs, integrations and AI use cases into optimal workspaces that are easy to adopt, manage and scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Design and deploy AI-native workflows using Notion AI, custom agents, automations, Workers, Developer Platform capabilities and adjacent AI tools, partnering with Forward Deployed Engineering when advanced technical depth is needed for migrations, API constraints, security architecture or frontier implementation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help customers navigate change by designing adoption plans, enablement materials and launch approaches that drive sustained usage and measurable business value.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify repeatable patterns across customer engagements and convert them into packaged solutions, templates, reference architectures, run books, enablement assets and product feedback.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Serve as a trusted advisor to customers, simplifying complex technical requirements, making practical tradeoff recommendations and helping stakeholders align around a clear implementation path.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner cross-functionally with GTM, Product, Engineering, PMM, Services leadership and the partner ecosystem to scale what works beyond individual customer engagements.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create clear implementation plans, handoff materials and success measures that align customers and int