get, risks and priorities.</li><li>Define how quality is measured and make sure solutions are evaluated before and after go-live.</li><li>Work with client stakeholders on data, security, compliance and change management.</li><li>Collaborate closely with our multicultural team and bring your own ideas to projects with real-world impact.</li></ul><h2>Requirements</h2><ul><li><strong>Experience:</strong> Several years of project management in software, data or digital transformation projects; AI or data projects are a strong plus.</li><li><strong>AI Understanding:</strong> A solid grasp of how large language models, retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) and AI agents work, what they are good at and where they fail.</li><li><strong>Technical Foundation:</strong> Enough understanding of software architecture and cloud infrastructure (ideally Microsoft Azure) to discuss solutions with engineers and client IT and security teams.</li><li><strong>Methods:</strong> Confident with agile delivery and with structuring ambiguous problems into concrete plans.</li><li><strong>Stakeholder Management:</strong> Experience working with business and IT stakeholders up to management level, including managing expectations about what AI can and cannot do.</li><li><strong>Data & Compliance:</strong> Awareness of data protection (Swiss FADP, GDPR) and information security in client projects.</li><li><strong>Communication Skills:</strong> Excellent German and English, written and spoken.</li><li><strong>Mindset:</strong> Structured, hands-on and curious, with the ownership to bring projects over the finish line.</li></ul><h2>Benefits</h2><ul><li><strong>Competitive Remuneration:</strong> A competitive salary package, reflecting your experience and contributions.</li><li><strong>Pick Your Gear:</strong> Choose your preferred devices for work.</li><li><strong>Attractive Benefits:</strong> above market pension benefits and a private accident insurance.</li><li><strong>Professional Growth:</strong> Participation in the Microsoft for Startups program, offering access to valuable resources, events and support.</li></ul><p>Interested in leading AI projects that make a real difference? We would be happy to hear from you.</p><p>Please send us your CV and, if available, examples of projects you have led.</p><p>Join ParetoLabs and shape how Swiss companies put AI to work!</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/paretolabs/ai-project-manager-zurich-184257","tags":["Software Development"],"job_types":["Indefinite contract (unbefristeter arbeitsvertrag)"],"location":"Zürich","created_at":1792873833},{"slug":"frontend-developer-intern-zurich-262783","company_name":"ParetoLabs","title":"Frontend Developer Intern","description":"<p>ParetoLabs is looking for a motivated and passionate <strong>Frontend Developer Intern</strong> with a love for building great user interfaces to join our growing team.</p><p>As part of our dynamic team, you will build the interfaces people use to work with our AI-driven applications. You will gain hands-on experience in designing, developing, testing, and shipping web applications for clients across a wide range of industries.</p><p><strong>About ParetoLabs</strong></p><p>ParetoLabs is a Zurich-based software studio that develops customized, AI-powered applications for conversational and text-processing use cases. We help companies quickly test, implement, and scale AI applications within their specific business environments.</p><p>Founded in 2023, ParetoLabs is a Microsoft for Startups partner that combines innovative AI technologies with the individual requirements of Swiss companies.</p><h2>Tasks</h2><ul><li>Build modern, responsive user interfaces for AI applications, including chat assistants, copilots and internal tools.</li><li>Turn designs into accessible, well-structured components in React and TypeScript (Next.js).</li><li>Connect the frontend to our APIs and handle loading, errors and streaming AI responses gracefully.</li><li>Collaborate closely with our multicultural team, sharing your ideas and learning from experienced colleagues.</li><li>Take ownership of defined tasks and bring your own ideas to projects with real-world impact.</li></ul><h2>Requirements</h2><ul><li><strong>Educational Background:</strong> Currently pursuing or recently completed a degree in computer science, software engineering, or a related field, or equivalent self-taught experience.</li><li><strong>Web Fundamentals:</strong> Practical experience with HTML, CSS and JavaScript or TypeScript through university, personal, or professional projects.</li><li><strong>Frontend Frameworks:</strong> First experience with React or a similar framework is an advantage; Next.js is a plus.</li><li><strong>How the Web Works:</strong> A good understanding of how browsers, HTTP and APIs work together, and of the difference between what runs on the server and in the browser.</li><li><strong>User Focus:</strong> Care for usability, accessibility and responsive design across devices.</li><li><strong>Developer Tools:</strong> Initial experience with Git and the browser's developer tools.</li><li><strong>Problem-Solving Skills:</strong> A curious, proactive, and solution-oriented mindset with a willingness to learn and take ownership of defined tasks.</li><li><strong>Teamwork:</strong> An open-minded team player who enjoys collaborating in a multicultural and interdisciplinary environment.</li><li><strong>Communication Skills:</strong> Good communication skills in English or German and the ability to communicate clearly with colleagues and project stakeholders.</li></ul><h2>Benefits</h2><ul><li><strong>Competitive Remuneration:</strong> A competitive salary package, reflecting your experience and contributions.</li><li><strong>Pick Your Gear:</strong> Choose your preferred devices for work.</li><li><strong>Attractive Benefits:</strong> above market pension benefits and a private accident insurance.</li><li><strong>Professional Growth:</strong> Participation in the Microsoft for Startups program, offering access to valuable resources, events and support.</li></ul><p>Interested in frontend development, user experience, and AI? We would be happy to hear from you.</p><p>Please send us your CV and, if available, links to your GitHub profile, portfolio or personal projects.</p><p>Join ParetoLabs and gain hands-on experience building modern AI applications!</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/paretolabs/frontend-developer-intern-zurich-262783","tags":["Software Development"],"job_types":["Internship (praktikumsvertrag)","internship"],"location":"Zürich","created_at":1792857646},{"slug":"senior-java-engineer-distributed-systems-serverless-elasticsearch-244252","company_name":"Elastic","title":"Senior Java Engineer - Distributed Systems, Serverless - Elasticsearch","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Is The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are on the lookout for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Elasticsearch - Distributed Systems team&lt;/strong&gt; and focus on how Elasticsearch provides scale, performance, and resilience, especially in the context of our Serverless offering. You will be tackling deep distributed systems challenges in how nodes in an Elasticsearch cluster communicate, and how data are indexed, allocated, and managed across nodes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraging your distributed systems expertise to build, and operate core pieces of our next-generation Serverless Elasticsearch offering, directly impacting the experience of customers worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving Elasticsearch’s components that support concurrent and consistent indexing across multiple machines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining our cluster coordination system to keep performance high even though nodes come and go from the cluster and data moves around, while maintaining the safety and liveness properties of the system as a whole.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pushing the limits on the number of shards, nodes, and petabytes that Elasticsearch can handle today.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Looking into all kinds of issues, including performance or concurrency issues, and proposing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting our support engineers with the harder problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning operational investigations end-to-end, until performance or stability issues are successfully resolved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a deep background in distributed systems and consensus algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong skills in core Java and are conversant in the standard library of data structures and concurrency constructs, as well as newer language features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a deep technical proficiency in algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have shown your ability to understand and work on complex, highly distributed systems, rather than making use of off-the-shelf services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate the ability to build and debug features with a broad impact, running on multiple machines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to own projects from beginning to end. This covers both technical design and working with others to develop needed components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of using AI to accelerate development, debug complex systems, and optimize code, while still owning the final outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You possess the ability to collaborate across functions and teams and seamlessly transition between different projects, codebases, or teams based on business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work autonomously, drive decisions and results in a distributed team by leveraging asynchronous, direct, and transparent communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data stores&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Search, analytics, Lucene&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the JDK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asynchronous event-driven network frameworks such as Netty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
