<p>Wij kijken uit naar jouw sollicitatie!</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/cbre-global-workplace-solutions/project-manager-managed-services-rotterdam-86018","tags":["Project Management"],"job_types":["Vast dienstverband (onbepaalde tijd)"],"location":"Rotterdam","created_at":1792920657},{"slug":"lifecycle-marketeer-part-time-fulltime-heerenveen-102377","company_name":"TAGGRS","title":"Lifecycle Marketeer (Part-time/Fulltime)","description":"<p>Do you know how to turn a HubSpot sequence, a sharp newsletter, or a well-timed sales asset into real engagement? Then this is your chance to own lifecycle marketing at TAGGRS.  </p>
<p>At TAGGRS, we help companies gain full control over their data through powerful server-side tracking solutions. Our ambition? To become the standard in the market. To get there, we need to stay close to our customers, partners, and community at every stage of their journey. That's where you come in.</p>
<h2>Tasks</h2>
<p>As our Lifecycle Marketeer, you make sure every customer, prospect, and partner gets the right message at the right moment. You build the sequences, content, and campaigns that keep TAGGRS top of mind, from first touch to customer and/or loyal advocate.  </p>
<p>Our aim is to build stronger connections and lasting relationships with our customers, prospects, and partners.  </p>
