ic background and/or belief—and strongly encourage people from underrepresented groups to apply. We also value more than the skills and experiences outlined in this job description. Even if you think you only fill 60% of the requirements for this role - we would still like to consider your application.</span></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/up42-gmbh/remote-senior-sales-manager-team-lead-emea-berlin-423272","tags":["Remote"],"job_types":["Manager","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Remote job","created_at":1792821093},{"slug":"senior-partner-berlin-125348","company_name":"True Talent Solutions Partners","title":"Senior Partner","description":"<h3>About the Role</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">A legal technology company is seeking a Germany-based Senior Partner to help grow an AI-enabled legal practice. You will bring an established client portfolio, continue advising those clients, and work with the team to move recurring legal matters onto AI-assisted workflows.</p><h3>What You'll Do</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring your portable client portfolio to the firm and continue serving those clients.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build relationships with private equity, venture capital, and mid-market clients to support business development.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify opportunities to provide commercial and compliance services across your client network.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with the founding team to assess and automate recurring legal matters using AI tools and agent-based workflows.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help shape the firm's growth and represent its legal services in the market.</p></li></ul><h3>What We're Looking For</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">12 to 20 or more years of German legal practice, including experience at partner level.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A German-qualified Volljurist admitted as a Rechtsanwalt, with native-level German and professional English.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A personally held, portable book of business valued at €1 million or more, with a diversified client base and relationships that can transition with you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience serving private equity or venture capital clients and their portfolio companies, with recurring work in areas such as commercial contracts, IT and data, corporate matters, or regulatory compliance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Practical experience using AI tools such as Claude, ChatGPT, or legal AI products, and a demonstrated interest in updating legal workflows through automation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to work in Germany and a feasible path to transition your client work.</p></li></ul><h3>Compensation &amp; Benefits</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Base salary: €200,000 to €300,000 annually. The role includes meaningful equity. Visa sponsorship is not available.</p><h3>Location</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Remote within Germany, with Berlin as the primary location.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/true-talent-solutions-partners/senior-partner-berlin-125348","tags":["Client Roles"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1792820422},{"slug":"senior-account-manager-kraken-flexibility-german-speaking-berlin-121317","company_name":"Kraken","title":"Senior Account Manager- Kraken Flexibility (German Speaking)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">Help us use technology to make a big green dent in the universe!</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://kraken.tech/"><u>Kraken</u></a> powers some of the most innovative global developments in energy.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We create the technology that redefines utilities and unlocks a new energy system of the future. By optimising renewable generation, building a more intelligent grid, and empowering utilities to deliver an exceptional customer experience, our operating system is transforming the industry worldwide.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">It’s an incredibly exciting time to work in energy. Join us on our mission to improve the lives of ONE BILLION humans within the decade and shape a cleaner, better future for everyone.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Kraken is seeking an exceptional Senior Account Manager to manage and grow a portfolio of Flexibility clients across Europe.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The role is responsible for building trusted stakeholder relationships, coordinating priorities across Kraken teams and helping clients grow and realise value from Kraken's portfolio of Flexibility products and services.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Working across multiple clients and markets, you'll need strong stakeholder management, prioritisation and communication skills. We're looking for a highly organised, proactive self-starter who can build trust, create clarity from complexity and drive progress in a fast-moving environment.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience of flexibility markets is highly advantageous. However, we also welcome exceptional candidates who can demonstrate strong stakeholder management, commercial awareness and an ability to drive outcomes in complex environments.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in one or more European languages, particularly German, would be valuable given the importance of the German market within our European client portfolio.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The role offers an opportunity to work with some of the most innovative flexibility clients in Europe and play a key role in supporting Kraken's continued international growth.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>What you'll do</u></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own and develop a portfolio of Flexibility client accounts across Europe.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as the primary point of coordination for your portfolio of clients, primarily Residential Flex and, where appropriate, Generation Flex services.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify opportunities to help clients grow their flexibility programmes and increase the value delivered through Kraken's products and services.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as a cross-functional leader, aligning priorities across Delivery, Product, Engineering and Customer Success, bringing together the right people to deliver successful client outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be the client advocate within Kraken whilst balancing the needs of the wider business.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain a deep understanding of high-priority features, client commitments and critical incidents so that you can communicate confidently with stakeholders and proactively drive delivery progress by ensuring risks, dependencies and blockers are actively managed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Provide clear communication, challenge constructively and hold stakeholders accountable for agreed outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Facilitate client governance, including QBRs, service reviews, strategic planning sessions and product roadmap reviews appropriate to the needs and maturity of each client.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prepare client reporting, account health and forecasting updates.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead commercial discussions where required.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ensure clients achieve meaningful outcomes and realise value from Kraken's Flexibility products and services.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>What you'll need</u></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience managing client relationships in a client-facing environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable managing multiple clients and priorities simultaneously.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to influence and align Product, Engineering, Delivery and Customer Success teams around shared client outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong stakeholder management, communication and influencing skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Highly organised, proactive and able to operate independently.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong written and verbal communication skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to lead through influence and create clarity in ambiguous situations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable navigating difficult conversations and holding others accountable.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Resilient, accountable and delivery focused</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated ability to build trusted relationships.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>Preferred Experience</u></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Energy industry experience.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Flexibility experience.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience of commercial negotiations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in one or more European languages, particularly German.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>What success looks like</u></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Clients view you as a trusted advisor and advocate.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Client priorities are clearly understood and effectively represented within Kraken.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Delivery challenges are identified early and managed proactively.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contract and commercial discussions are managed successfully.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Clients continue to realise increasing value from Kraken's products and services, supporting both customer success and business portfolio growth.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Flex priorities are effectively represented across Kraken, ensuring client needs are reflected in Product, Delivery and Customer Success.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><u>Our Values</u></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Kraken, we are guided by the following principles:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Customer Obsession</strong> – We maintain a relentless focus on delivering exceptional client outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Freedom &amp; Responsibility</strong> – We empower our people and expect high levels of personal accountability.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Get Shit Done</strong> – We prioritize rapid action and effective execution.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Purple</strong> – We remain human, curious, and deeply collaborative.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Are you ready for a career with us? We want to ensure you have the right tools and environment to unleash your potential. If you have any accommodation requests, please contact us at ----- We’ll do our best to tailor the experience to your needs so you can feel comfortable, confident and be at your best!</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>Studies have shown that some groups of people, like women, are less likely to apply to a role unless they meet 100% of the job requirements. Whoever you are, if you like one of our jobs, we encourage you to apply as you might just be the candidate we’re looking for! At Kraken, we're creating a team of genuine, honest, empathetic people. Our people are our strongest asset and the unique skills and perspectives people bring to the team are the driving force of our success. As an equal opportunity employer, we do not discriminate on the basis of any protected attribute. We consider all applicants without regard to race, colour, religion, national origin, age, sex, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, marital or veteran status, disability, or any other legally protected status.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">*Our (i) <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://kraken.tech/candidate-privacy-notice"><u>Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice and Artificial Intelligence (AI) Notice</u></a>, (ii) <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://kraken.tech/privacy-notice"><u>Website Privacy Notice</u></a> and (iii) <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://kraken.tech/cookie-notice"><u>Cookie Notice</u></a> govern the collection and use of your personal data in connection with your application and use of our website. These policies explain how we handle your data and outline your rights under applicable laws, including, but not limited to, the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA). Depending on your location, you may have the right to access, correct, or delete your information, object to processing, or withdraw consent. By applying, you acknowledge that you’ve read, understood and consent to these terms</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Please note that, in line with our current recruitment policy, we are unable to offer visa sponsorship for this position; applicants must have the right to work in the country that they're applying to, at the time of application.*</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/kraken/senior-account-manager-kraken-flexibility-german-speaking-berlin-121317","tags":["Customer Success"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin, Germany","created_at":1792820422},{"slug":"senior-digital-creative-design-for-dm-drogerie-markt-berlin-de-208515","company_name":"wongdoody","title":"Senior Digital Creative Design – for dm-drogerie markt","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Wir sind WongDoody, mit mehr als 2.000 Kolleg:innen in 24 Designstudios auf vier Kontinenten&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24);&quot;&gt; – ein hochgradig kollaboratives Team aus Expert:innen für Produkterlebnisse, digitales Marketing und immersive Technologien. Unsere Lösungen entstehen dort, wo Kreativität und Technologie zusammentreffen – mit einem klaren Fokus auf die Bedürfnisse und Erlebnisse der Nutzer:innen. Ob Augmented Reality, Digital Twins, KI-Ökosysteme, Omnichannel-Commerce oder integrierte Kampagnen: Wir schaffen Verbindungen zwischen Menschen und Marken – im B2B- ebenso wie im B2C-Bereich.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Als Teil des globalen Technologieinnovators Infosys verfügen wir über die nötige Skalierung und Expertise, um große Ideen Wirklichkeit werden zu lassen – und sie weltweit umzusetzen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;WongDoody xdm&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Für dm-drogerie markt, Deutschlands beliebtesten Einzelhändler, sind wir seit 2010 die digitale Lead-Agentur und haben das Unternehmen bei jedem Schritt der Transformation vom stationären Handel zum Omni-Channel begleitet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;In enger Zusammenarbeit mit den dm-Niederlassungen in Deutschland, Österreich und Osteuropa betreuen und entwickeln mehr als 50 kreative Köpfe die Strategie und E-Commerce-Plattformen für dm in diesen Ländern und kümmern sich gleichzeitig um alle anderen Online-Aktivitäten wie Social Media, CRM, Digital Branding, Kampagnen und Content Marketing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Unsere lokalen Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Flexible Arbeitszeiten&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Arbeiten von wo es für dich passt. Zu Hause oder im Büro, ganz nach deinem Geschmack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Arbeit für starke Marken und Kund:innen, an die wir glauben&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Zuschuss beim Urban Sports Club&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;﻿Mitarbeitervorteile &amp;amp; Rabatte über Corporate Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;aufgeschlossene &amp;amp; nette Menschen in allen Teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Das erwartet Dich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; background-color: inherit;&quot;&gt;Entwicklung von einzigartigen Look &amp;amp; Feels sowie differenzierenden visuellen Leitideen für digitale Kampagnen und kanalübergreifende Kommunikation – stets im Einklang mit dem dm Corporate Design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Entwicklung und Gestaltung von außergewöhnlichen Kampagnenideen, einzigartigen digitalen Erlebnissen und relevanten Online-Kommunikationskonzepten – im Sparring mit Strategie &amp;amp; Konzept – für unseren abwechslungsreichen Kunden dm-drogerie markt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; background-color: inherit;&quot;&gt;Strategische und visuelle Weiterentwicklung des dm Corporate Designs sowie Sicherstellung einer konsistenten Umsetzung über alle digitalen Touchpoints hinweg&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Verantwortungsbewusstes und proaktives Arbeiten in interdisziplinären Projektteams (Account Management, Strategie, Konzeption, Design, Kunde)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Sehr gerne gehst Du in den inhaltlichen Lead von Projekten, treibst es voran und spielst eine relevante Rolle, wenn es um die Beratung unserer Kunden geht&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Vorbereiten und Durchführen von Präsentationen intern und vor Ort bei dm-drogerie markt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Das bringst Du mit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Abgeschlossenes Grafik- oder Designstudium oder eine vergleichbare Ausbildung&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Mind. 3-4 Jahre Berufserfahrung in einer Agentur oder einem&lt;/span&gt; ähnlich dynamischen Arbeitsumfeld&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ein besonders gutes Gespür für zielgruppengerechte Kommunikation, kreative Kampagnen, Social Media Inhalte und digitale Gestaltung (still und bewegt)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;KI ist für dich kein notwendiges Übel, sondern ein Hebel für mehr Qualität, Geschwindigkeit und Kreativität&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit Shootings, die du art-direktorisch betreust&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Sehr gute Kenntnisse innerhalb der Adobe Creative Suite (idealerweise auch After Effects)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Du bringst Leidenschaft für Deinen Beruf verbunden mit einem sehr hohen D&lt;/span&gt;esign- und Qualitätsanspruch mit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Du besitzt Teamplayer-Mentalität, bist proaktiv und lösungsorientiert&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Du hast Lust, andere Kolleg:innen mit deinem Wissen und deiner Erfahrung zu motivieren&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Idealerweise Erfahrung in der Anleitung von Teammitgliedern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Sehr gute Deutsch- und zusätzliche gute Englischkenntnisse von Vorteil&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(24, 24, 24);&quot;&gt;Klingt nach Dir? Dann schnapp Dir Deinen Laptop und bewirb Dich – wir freuen uns, Dich auf unserer kreativen Reise dabei zu haben! &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Für u﻿ns zählt allein Deine Persönlichkeit und Deine beruflichen Fähigkeiten. Dein Geschlecht, Alter oder Aussehen, Deine Herkunft oder sexuelle Orientierung spielen für uns keine Rolle – wir sind offen für die Zusammenarbeit mit jeder Person.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Beachte bitte: Dies ist eine Stellenanzeige der WongDoody GmbH mit Sitz in Deutschland. Über unsere Website oder andere Quellen kannst Du zu Stellenanzeigen gelangen, die von einer unserer WongDoody-Schwesterfirmen veröffentlicht wurden, mit denen wir weltweit gemeinsam unter der Marke &quot;WongDoody&quot; auftreten. Für jedes Stellenangebot ist ausschließlich das Unternehmen verantwortlich, das die jeweilige Anzeige veröffentlicht hat. Ansprechpartner:innen, erforderliche Angaben und geltende Bedingungen können jeweils abweichen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wongdoody.com/wongdoody-germany-privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Hier&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;kannst Du Dich darüber informieren, wie die WongDoody GmbH Deine im Bewerbungsprozess angegebenen personenbezogenen Daten verarbeitet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Wenn&amp;nbsp;Du&amp;nbsp;Fragen&amp;nbsp;zum&amp;nbsp;Bewerbungsprozess&amp;nbsp;hast,&amp;nbsp;wende&amp;nbsp;Dich&amp;nbsp;gerne&amp;nbsp;direkt&amp;nbsp;an&amp;nbsp;unser&amp;nbsp;People&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Culture-Team&amp;nbsp;unter&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-size: -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/wongdoody/senior-digital-creative-design-for-dm-drogerie-markt-berlin-de-208515","tags":["Design"],"job_types":[],"location":"Berlin, DE","created_at":1792810524},{"slug":"senior-manager-people-operations-berlin-243347","company_name":"planetlabs","title":"Senior Manager, People Operations","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet’s People Operations team manages a wide variety of operational functions, including compliance, HRIS and hire-to-retire transactions, immigration, global mobility, people data and analytics, and payroll. We are seeking an experienced Senior People Operations Manager to oversee people operations across Europe, MENA, and APAC while ensuring alignment with global frameworks and strategic objectives. This role will drive regional strategy, oversee operational compliance, and lead key strategic initiatives such as global expansion and HRIS optimization. Ideal candidates are adaptable, collaborative leaders with a background in scaling regional HR operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will report to the US-based Director, People Operations and will partner closely with roles across the global People Team and beyond, particularly on the Talent Acquisition, People Business Partnership, and Legal teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, hybrid role which will require you to work from our Berlin, Haarlem, or London office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearheads and manages the Europe-based People Operations team, setting operational standards and overseeing hire-to-retire processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serves as the primary subject matter expert and escalation point for regional HR operations, complex legal compliance, and employment policies in Europe, MENA, and APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partners with cross-functional leadership—including Talent Acquisition, People Business Partners, and Legal—to align regional practices with global business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishes and maintains strategic vendor relationships, including external legal counsel and Employers of Record (EORs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives continuous process improvements by designing scalable workflows, standard operating procedures (SOPs), and integrating AI tools across team workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads departmental initiatives supporting global expansion, HRIS optimization, and workforce data reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of relevant HR/People Operations experience across international regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of supervisory/people leadership experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of employment law, HR operations, and compliance standards across EMEA and APAC regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing operational objectives, procedures, and entity setups in new international markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience utilizing HRIS platforms (e.g., HiBob) and data spreadsheet tools for workforce analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to persuade and align internal stakeholders in complex or sensitive situations while preserving positive working relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing departmental budgets, vendor contracts, and external partner relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI tools (e.g., Gemini) and integrating AI into operational workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in additional HR disciplines such as employee relations or HR business partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within US-headquartered, publicly traded organizations subject to audit controls (e.g., SOX)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multilingual capabilities in Dutch, French, or other European languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The expected starting gross salary range for this role is listed below. Individual placement within this range is determined objectively based on gender-neutral criteria such as your skills, qualifications, and professional experience. This position may also be eligible for discretionary bonuses and/or equity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to the salary range listed below, this role is also eligible to receive commission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Germany Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€86.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.300 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Pursuant to the San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance, we will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we care so much about Belonging.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We’re dedicated to helping the whole Planet, and to do that we must strive to represent all of it within each of our offices and on all of our teams. That’s why Planet is guided by an ultimate north star of Belonging—dreaming big as we approach our ongoing work.&amp;nbsp; If this job intrigues you, but you’re thinking you might not have all the qualifications, please... do apply!&amp;nbsp; At Planet, we are looking for well-rounded people from around the world who can contribute to more ways than just what is listed in this job description.&amp;nbsp; We don’t just fill positions, we aspire to fulfill people’s careers, most excited about folks who are motivated by our underlying humanitarian efforts.&amp;nbsp; We are a few orbits around the sun before we get to where we want to be, so we hope you’re excited to come along for the ride.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EEO statement: &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is committed to building a community where everyone belongs and we invite people from all backgrounds to apply. Planet is an equal opportunity employer, and committed to providing employment opportunities regardless of race, religious creed, color, national origin, ancestry, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, pregnancy, childbirth and breastfeeding, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other protected classification, in accordance with applicable federal, state, and local laws. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt;Know Your Rights.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Planet is an inclusive community and we know that everyone has their own needs. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation during the hiring process, please reach out to ----- or contact your recruiter with your request. Your message will be confidential and we will be happy to assist you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/#california&quot;&gt;Planet Data Privacy Notice for California Staff Members and Applicants&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy (European Applicants):&lt;/strong&gt; By clicking &quot;Apply Now&quot; at the top of this job posting, I acknowledge that I have read the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.planet.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice GDPR Planet Labs Europe&lt;/a&gt;, and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI in Our Interviewing Process&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet is committed to providing an exceptional interview experience for all candidates. We currently use &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.metaview.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Metaview&lt;/a&gt; to better focus on candidates and less on trying to capture notes. As such, with the candidate&#39;s consent, select interviews may be recorded and include a &quot;Planet AI Notetaker&quot; for transcription and summarization purposes. Should an interview involve use of AI interview technologies, the candidate will receive notification and have the ability to opt out both in advance and/or real-time. Opting out will not affect one&#39;s candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate AI Policy&lt;/strong&gt;: Planet embraces Artificial Intelligence (AI) tools, and we encourage its responsible use. We understand that candidates may use various resources, including AI tools, to &lt;em&gt;prepare&lt;/em&gt; for interviews and assessments. However, &lt;em&gt;during any live interview stage or when actively completing assessments for this position, the use of AI tools—e.g. Large Language Models (LLMs), deep fake technology, etc.—is strictly prohibited unless explicitly prompted by an interviewer or assessment instructions&lt;/em&gt;. If you are unsure about acceptable use, please contact your recruiter for clarification. If an AI tool or similar technology is desired as an accommodation, please contact ----- with your request for assistance. Your message will be confidential, and we will be happy to assist you. Violation of this policy may result in disqualification of your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/planetlabs/senior-manager-people-operations-berlin-243347","tags":["People Operations"],"job_types":[],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1792810523},{"slug":"senior-application-product-manager-supply-chain-procurement-munich-57448","company_name":"celonis","title":"Senior Application Product Manager - Supply Chain - Procurement","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Celonis Business Apps Supply Chain team is an innovative group of product and technology enthusiasts focused on creating and deploying next-generation solutions in the Supply Chain domain. We are transforming how enterprise solutions are built driven by our customers&#39; business critical problems. Our team strikes an ideal balance between deep technical execution (including advanced data engineering and AI tooling) and a sharp customer focus to create highly impactful products that accelerate value realization across our customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will gain experience in the Supply Chain and related processes and act as the interface between customers, our Go-To-Market and our Product &amp;amp; Engineering teams, shaping the future of Celonis’ product offering in this domain. Take this chance to rethink the way companies run their Supply Chain processes, with a specific focus on Procurement and help our customers to accelerate their value realization with Celonis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Application Product Manager for Procurement, you will operate at the intersection of customer-facing solution engineering and core product innovation to architect and deploy cutting-edge enterprise AI solutions. In this hybrid role, you will partner directly with strategic customers to build bespoke, composable procurement and supply chain architectures using the Celonis Context Model (CCM) and advanced decision intelligence. By leveraging modern AI tooling and LLM-based coding agents, you will abstract field insights into reusable semantic libraries, directly accelerating Celonis&#39; global agentic deployment workflows. You get hands-on: prototyping on the platform, wiring up data, building AI-driven solutions, and iterating directly with the people who&#39;ll use them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission is to make the vision of AI-powered solutions a reality by building products that turn the cutting edge capabilities of the Celonis&amp;nbsp; Platform from strategy into solutions that customers use to run their Procurement processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Solution Blueprinting:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct collaborative discovery workshops to uncover root-causes and operational inefficiencies, mapping ambiguous customer needs into clear technical scopes and comprehensive solution blueprints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context Model &amp;amp; Solution Deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute hands-on deployments of customer-specific context models, data structures, and end-to-end supply chain blueprints within the Celonis platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management &amp;amp; Customer Value:&lt;/strong&gt; Own customer deployments end-to-end from initial kickoff to live production, presenting complex architectural solutions and strategic value narratives directly to cross-functional stakeholders and executive teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype &amp;amp; Test Functions:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, validate, and test use-case-specific decision intelligence functions, including e.g. optimization algorithms and predictive models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Deconstruct monolithic application architectures and translate deployment learnings into reusable semantic entities and modular context libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are passionate about Procurement, Supply Chain, the Celonis technology, and what it can do for our customers, here&#39;s your chance to directly contribute to taking our Celonis Platform and Context Model to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience as a Solution Engineer, Product Engineer, Technical Product Manager, Founding/Forward-Deployed Engineer, Implementation Consultant or a comparable technical, customer-facing role hybrid role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive knowledge of core operational workflows in supply chain and procurement. You can speak the language of C-suite executives and seamlessly connect complex, systemic bottlenecks to strategic AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building coherent solutions, not just isolated features. You think in terms of the whole solution and how the pieces fit together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in data analysis and data modeling including tools native to the Celonis platform: SQL, Python, quick to pick up new tools and platforms and able to prototype and build. Experience with platform-native tools like PQL is a significant asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced architectural mastery of LLM orchestration, tool use/function calling, RAG, agents, prompt engineering, and agentic patterns for enterprise workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on exposure to enterprise architectures, with ERP systems (such as SAP or Oracle) or Material Requirements Planning (MRP) logic considered a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated project management capabilities accompanied by excellent planning and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creativity in problem-solving, a solution-oriented mindset, and the ability to work autonomously while collaborating smoothly across multi-disciplinary squads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills and the willingness to work very closely with customers and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in spoken and written English (knowledge of German is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot; data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;197289803&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/celonis/senior-application-product-manager-supply-chain-procurement-munich-57448","tags":["Product Business Apps"],"job_types":[],"location":"Munich","created_at":1792810523},{"slug":"intern-technology-consultant-data-ai-munich-355551","company_name":"celonis","title":"Intern Technology Consultant - Data & AI","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis Services is the delivery engine of our Celonis Customer Organization, responsible for turning the Celonis platform into measurable, business-critical outcomes for our customers. In the AI era, our role has elevated: as AI agents like our own Apollo take on more of the technical build, our people focus on the work that drives real impact — understanding our customers&#39; business-critical problems, designing the solutions that solve them, and quantifying the value delivered. Our team pairs deep domain and industry expertise with serious platform mastery and AI-augmented delivery, directing agentic systems while owning the judgment, architecture, and customer relationships that AI cannot replace. We deliver faster and smarter than ever, and we own the outcome: solution go-live, solution adoption, initial value realization support and the long-term success of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an intern, you will have the unique opportunity to learn and grow through hands-on experiences. Your role will involve utilizing our cutting-edge AI deployment tools to develop innovative solutions for our customers, together with more experienced Deployment Engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional engineering role where you build everything manually. You will be introduced to AI-augmented and business-focused software delivery: helping specify what needs to be built, learning to direct AI agents to execute, and assisting in validating the results. Participation in team meetings and workshops will offer valuable insights into the decision-making process within the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Initiate and Connect&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct customer-facing sessions with experienced Deployment Engineers to discuss ongoing projects, translate strategic objectives into use cases, and receive guidance on best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in gathering and organizing relevant data from various sources, ensuring data accuracy and consistency for analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn to direct AI deployment agents (like Apollo) to build data models, process analyses, KPIs, and dashboards by helping to write clear specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct exploratory data analysis, utilizing Celonis and other tools to uncover trends, process inefficiencies, and root causes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in defining the initial solution design blueprint and configuring operational solutions across the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Value &amp;amp; Rollout&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the validation of AI-generated outputs for accuracy and business relevance alongside senior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop and maintain KPIs to track the success of project initiatives and quantify business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in documenting solution design decisions and configurations for future reference and customer handover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes This Role Different in the AI Era&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will learn to work with AI agents as your primary tools, focusing on validating and refining their output rather than writing every line of code manually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will develop foundational specification and context engineering skills to help translate business needs into precise AI instructions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As you navigate a fast-paced environment, you will learn how to adapt quickly to changes and new approaches as AI capabilities evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualifications You Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Student of Technology Management, Business (-Informatics), Computer Science, Engineering, Economics, or a comparable degree program with outstanding performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know-how in Business Intelligence, data analytics, and a foundational understanding of enterprise business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in programming and working with databases; knowledge in SQL, Python, or related coding- and/or database query languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and basic familiarity with AI-assisted development tools, coupled with an eagerness to learn prompt/context engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in working with customers, along with awesome presentation and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to demonstrate initiative, work independently, and think outside of the box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and German (any additional language is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 months of full-time availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
