<li>Perform code reviews, enforce coding standards, troubleshoot and debug complex issues, and ensure high code quality and performance.</li>
<li>Stay up to date with new technologies and tools, drive their adoption when appropriate, and contribute to a culture of continuous learning and team growth.</li>
