<li>Extensive experience in backend development, with solid knowledge of event-driven architectures, microservices, and domain-driven design.</li>
<li>Strong English communication skills and the ability to collaborate effectively within multidisciplinary teams.</li>
<li>Self-motivated, proactive, and accountable, with strong problem-solving skills and a growth mindset.</li>
