</li>
<li>
<p>Every commercial decision lands inside clinical guardrails. Build a relationship with the clinical team where each side trusts the other's judgement, because patients need both.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Bring hands-on experience of AI in a commercial setting: analysis, forecasting, CRM,</p>
