<p style="margin: 15pt 0cm 6pt; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size: 13.0pt;">About Enroly</span></strong></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Enroly helps universities transform the journey from application to arrival. Our platform combines Apply and CAS Shield to help institutions capture complete, decision-ready application data, streamline admissions workflows, manage international CAS issuance and strengthen compliance, creating one connected experience for applicants, agents and university teams.</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">We now work with over 100 UK universities, and hundreds of thousands of students and thousands of agents use the platform each year. Our data platform gives universities and key government contacts real-time, sector-wide insight to inform strategy.</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">In 2024, Enroly became part of Ecctis, a company with 30 years of being a globally respected authority in education, training, and skills development.</p>
<p style="margin: 15pt 0cm 6pt; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size: 13.0pt;">About the role</span></strong></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Reporting to the Group Chief Commercial Officer (CCO), you will develop new university partnerships from first conversation through to signed contract. You will lead a team of senior sales professionals while developing your own opportunities, leading from the front to demonstrate best practice, deliver results and raise your team’s commercial capability.</p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">The location is remote, with regular travel to our London office, university campuses and sector events.</p>
<p style="margin: 15pt 0cm 6pt; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size: 13.0pt;">What you’ll do</span></strong></p>
<p style="margin: 10pt 0cm 4pt; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size: 11.0pt;">University partnership growth</span></strong></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 3.0pt;">
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 3pt 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Own a personal pipeline of new universities, from first conversation to signed contract.</li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 3pt 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Lead complex sales involving directors and C-suite leaders across multiple departments, helping clients make informed purchasing decisions.</li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 3pt 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Drive conversion through university buying cycles, including frameworks, tenders and business cases.</li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 3pt 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Negotiate commercial terms and close deals that build sustainable, long-term client relationships.</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin: 10pt 0cm 4pt; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size: 11.0pt;">Team leadership</span></strong></p>
<ul style="margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 3.0pt;">
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 3pt 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Lead a team of senior sales professionals, setting individual targets with the CCO.</li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 3pt 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Run weekly pipeline reviews and coach live deals.</li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 3pt 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Embed the MEDDIC sales methodology and build team capability.</li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 3pt 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Develop the team’s higher education knowledge and relationship skills.</li>
<li style="margin: 0cm 0cm 3pt 0px; font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Address underperformance quickly and fairly and celebrate wins visibly.</li>
