ly with experience setting up such workflows in a legal team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Additional depth in formal legal training, CLM platforms (e.g., Ironclad), publishing-house contracts, or European languages (French, German, Spanish, etc.) is welcome.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What We Offer</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to support your well-being, growth, and work-life balance. Benefits vary by country and may include healthcare coverage, parental leave, retirement plans, relocation support, wellness programs, meal and transportation allowances, and other location-specific perks.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For the most up-to-date details on benefits available in your location, please refer to our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://app.notion.com/p/mistralai/Benefits-at-Mistral-36e6ba59a7fe836b93dd01737fcc27ef?source=copy_link">Benefits page</a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Privacy Policy</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your privacy matters to us. You can learn more about how we handle your personal data in our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://legal.mistral.ai/terms/applicant-privacy-policy"><u>Applicant Privacy Policy</u></a>.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/mistralai/ip-rights-manager-paris-315528","tags":["Legal"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Paris","created_at":1792874418},{"slug":"senior-full-stack-product-engineer-paris-157871","company_name":"The Flex","title":"Senior Full-Stack Product Engineer","description":"<h2>About Us</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Base360.ai"><strong>Base360.ai</strong></a> is the AI operating system for short-term rental businesses, helping 