inate repetitive work—from scheduling cleaning after a booking to sending check-in instructions and generating owner statements.</p><h3>Develop AI-Powered Systems</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use LLMs and AI agents to automate guest communication, triage maintenance requests, support pricing decisions, and help operators manage their portfolios more efficiently.</p><h3>Design API-First Architecture</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create robust APIs that connect internal services, booking channels, third-party providers, and customer systems.</p><h3>Integrate the Ecosystem</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and maintain integrations with platforms including Airbnb, Hostaway, Stripe, Twilio, OpenAI, Google, and other strategic partners across the short-term rental ecosystem.</p><h3>Scale Infrastructure</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deploy and manage cloud-native infrastructure designed for reliability, performance, and global growth across multiple property management businesses.</p><h3>Solve Complex Operational Problems</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build solutions for:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Real-time reservation and availability synchronization</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Dynamic pricing intelligence</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Smart lock access and key management</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Automated guest communication across channels</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Operational forecasting</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cleaning and maintenance automation</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Owner reporting and financial workflows</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AI-powered monitoring and alerts</p></li></ul><h3>Move Fast and Own Delivery</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own projects end-to-end—from understanding an operator’s problem to architecture, implementation, deployment, and ongoing improvement.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring senior engineering judgment to technical decisions, code reviews, and the reliability of the systems you build.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Tech Stack</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We care more about capability than specific technologies, but our current stack includes:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Python</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">FastAPI</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">React</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">TypeScript</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Supabase</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">PostgreSQL</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">AWS</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Serverless architecture</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">OpenAI APIs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Twilio</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stripe</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Docker</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">GitHub Actions</p></li></ul><h2>You Might Be a Great Fit If You Have</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong experience building and owning production-grade software systems</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with FastAPI, Python, React, or similar frameworks</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong understanding of APIs, distributed systems, and cloud architecture</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience designing scalable backend systems and reliable data models</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to work independently and make sound technical decisions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong problem-solving skills and a product mindset</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Curiosity about AI, automation, and operational efficiency</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A bias toward action, shipping, and learning from real users</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to balance delivery speed with maintainability and reliability</p></li></ul><p style=