 the company's most watched metrics: our customer acquisition cost.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why is this role interesting?</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High-impact scope</strong>: You'll work across the full sales organization, from Account Executives to BDRs, Account Management, and Customer Success Managers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Real ownership</strong>: You'll own initiatives end to end, from strategy and design to execution and adoption, not just delivery.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Builder's playground</strong>: You'll have access to a modern stack, combining low-code tools, AI (Dust, Claude), Salesforce, and SQL, to ship things fast and at scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Tangible results</strong>: Recent examples from our roadmap include fully automating slide deck generation for Sales (saving 1,000+ hours per year) and building an AI-powered outbound machine reaching a 15% discovery rate.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What will you do with us?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll own effectiveness initiatives end to end, setting the roadmap, designing the solution, building it, driving execution, and managing change across the organization. You'll spend meaningful time in the field to spot gaps in our sales process, then design smarter workflows by eliminating steps and increasing automation. You'll evaluate new tools and technologies, run tests, and roll out what works.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll mostly work with low-code tools (like Zapier or n8n), AI, Salesforce, SQL via Metabase, and whatever else the job calls for. Enablement is a key part of the role: you'll shadow, train, measure adoption, and iterate until change sticks.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>⭐ Is it you we're looking for?</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"><st