ills and the ability to collaborate effectively with a technical team</li><li><strong>German language skills preferred; English is also an option</strong></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/coopers-group-ag/data-engineer-nifi-zurich-71679","tags":["IT"],"job_types":["Befristeter arbeitsvertrag","contract"],"location":"Zürich","created_at":1792659671},{"slug":"senior-manager-client-zurich-350860","company_name":"wppmedia","title":"Senior Manager Client (m/w/d)","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
